        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;&#39; -------------------- 6. SYSTEM SEQUENCE (SSD): UC-01 --------------------\n@startuml Sada_Sequence_UC01\ntitle UC-01 — Execute Internal Transfer (System Sequence Diagram)\nautonumber\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam sequence {\n  ActorBorderColor #334155\n  ParticipantBorderColor #334155\n  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC\n  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B\n  ArrowColor #334155\n}\n\nactor Customer\nparticipant \&quot;Sada Platform\&quot; as System\n\nCustomer -&gt; System: submitInternalTransfer(destinationAccount, amount)\nSystem --&gt; Customer: promptOTPChallenge()\nCustomer -&gt; System: submitOTP(otpCode)\nSystem -&gt; System: authenticateSession(), verifyOTP(),\\ncheckBalanceAndDailyLimit(), evaluateRiskRules()\n\nalt Authentication, OTP, balance, or limit check fails\n  System --&gt; Customer: returnError(reason)\nelse Risk decision == PASS\n  System -&gt; System: postDoubleEntryLedger(),\\nupdateBalances(), recordAuditEvent()\n  System --&gt; Customer: returnTransferReceipt(transferId, status=\&quot;COMPLETED\&quot;)\nelse Manual review required\n  System -&gt; System: freezeAmount(), createHeldTransfer(),\\nopenReviewCase(), recordAuditEvent()\n  System --&gt; Customer: returnPendingReview(transferId, caseId, status=\&quot;HELD\&quot;)\nend\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="TgTziPrXvUSxa3XX-cSn-1">
